19.4.2 Duplicate payments
A Same-Same-Same test (Chapter 34): the same bank account, the same amount and the same date, under different voucher numbers. We restrict it to contingent and works bills, where a repeated payment is suspicious. (Salaries and pensions legitimately repeat the same amount every month, though not on the same date.)

duplicates &lt;- vouchers |&gt;
  filter(bill_type %in% c("Contingent", "Works")) |&gt;
  summarise(times_paid = n(), .by = c(payee_account, amount, voucher_date)) |&gt;
  filter(times_paid &gt; 1)

duplicates |&gt;
  summarise(groups = n(), excess_paid = sum(amount * (times_paid - 1), na.rm = TRUE)) |&gt;
  collect()

# A tibble: 1 × 2
  groups excess_paid
   &lt;dbl&gt;       &lt;dbl&gt;
